rs ist einzigartig.<\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}},"template--18049470005516__179d69e3-1373-40a2-92ff-f6e68918fbb5-column-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Mood22Q1_Home_Esstisch_Still_Toffee_stehend_D_klein_1_1.jpg","title":"Toffee","text":"<p>Unser bernsteinfarbige Schnaps “Toffee” bietet dir eine süß-kräftige, doch äußerst angenehme rauchige Karamell-Note.<\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}}},"block_order":["template--18049470005516__179d69e3-1373-40a2-92ff-f6e68918fbb5-column-2","template--18049470005516__179d69e3-1373-40a2-92ff-f6e68918fbb5-column-3","87c4baff-6a63-4d69-9c8b-109206cb3f25","template--18049470005516__179d69e3-1373-40a2-92ff-f6e68918fbb5-column-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"title":"","heading_size":"h1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"adapt","columns_desktop":4,"column_alignment":"left","background_style":"primary","button_label":"","button_link":"","color_scheme":"background-1","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":true,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"dbc9186f-95f5-4922-a676-9a8c15ee5a7f":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"template--18043048132876__dbc9186f-95f5-4922-a676-9a8c15ee5a7f-column-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Stills_Marc.png","title":"Thomas","text":"<p>\"Sehr wilder Geschmack und definitiv ein einzigartiges Design. Tolle Box zum kennenlernen der Marke\"<\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}},"template--18043048132876__dbc9186f-95f5-4922-a676-9a8c15ee5a7f-column-2":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Stills_Jule.png","title":"Kira","text":"<p>\"Noch nie vorher von gehört, aber super lecker. Mit der Tasting Box kann man gleich mehrere Sorten probieren und seinen Liebling rausfinden\"<\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}},"template--18043048132876__dbc9186f-95f5-4922-a676-9a8c15ee5a7f-column-3":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Stills_Can.png","title":"Francesco","text":"<p>\"Die Box ist genial um O'Donnell und seine Sorten kennenzulernen. Mich haben die Geschmäcker voll überzeugt. Mehr davon bitte!\"<\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}}},"block_order":["template--18043048132876__dbc9186f-95f5-4922-a676-9a8c15ee5a7f-column-1","template--18043048132876__dbc9186f-95f5-4922-a676-9a8c15ee5a7f-column-2","template--18043048132876__dbc9186f-95f5-4922-a676-9a8c15ee5a7f-column-3"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"title":"","heading_size":"h2","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"adapt","columns_desktop":3,"column_alignment":"center","background_style":"primary","button_label":"","button_link":"","color_scheme":"background-1","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":true,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"a524cd34-8f77-43c7-8eb3-82b5981c7dad":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--18043048132876__a524cd34-8f77-43c7-8eb3-82b5981c7dad-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Harte Nuss","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--18043048132876__a524cd34-8f77-43c7-8eb3-82b5981c7dad-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Die Harte Nuss ist die unangefochtene Nummer Eins und unser Bestseller - natürlich nicht ohne Grund. Überzeug dich selber und werde zum Moonshiner.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--18043048132876__a524cd34-8f77-43c7-8eb3-82b5981c7dad-heading-1","template--18043048132876__a524cd34-8f77-43c7-8eb3-82b5981c7dad-text-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Mood22Q1_Home_Esstisch_Still_HarteNuss_stehend_D_klein_1_1.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"33f92ba6-6026-4162-8b31-1e815486233b":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--18043048132876__33f92ba6-6026-4162-8b31-1e815486233b-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Pralle Kirsche","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--18043048132876__33f92ba6-6026-4162-8b31-1e815486233b-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Unsere \"Pralle Kirsche\" schmeckt wie frisch gepflückt vom Baum. Süß und vollmundig, dabei aber mit dem gewissem Etwas.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--18043048132876__33f92ba6-6026-4162-8b31-1e815486233b-heading-1","template--18043048132876__33f92ba6-6026-4162-8b31-1e815486233b-text-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/22Q3_Garden-036_2000_1_1_0782e761-2763-425b-b6bb-d9e59cbe6ca1.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"4e1951f9-0f70-42fc-9336-47b25ceaeea2":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--18043048132876__4e1951f9-0f70-42fc-9336-47b25ceaeea2-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Passionsfrucht","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--18043048132876__4e1951f9-0f70-42fc-9336-47b25ceaeea2-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Mit den tropischen Passionsfrüchten schlagen wir eine ganz neue Richtung in unserem Geschmacksportfolio ein und verbinden damit Moonshine-Tradition mit außergewöhnlichen Zutaten.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--18043048132876__4e1951f9-0f70-42fc-9336-47b25ceaeea2-heading-1","template--18043048132876__4e1951f9-0f70-42fc-9336-47b25ceaeea2-text-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Passionsfrucht_Launch_hoch_1x1_D.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"i